      en: ["Elevation: 838 m", "Location: County Kerry, Ireland", "Part of Killarney National Park", "Corrie lake: Devil's Punchbowl, depth ~30 m", "Rock type: Old Red Sandstone", "Annual visitors: over 50,000"],
