      en: ["Mount Collier reaches an elevation of 498 metres.", "It is located in the Shehy Mountains of western Cork.", "The mountain consists of Devonian Old Red Sandstone.", "Nearby Gougane Barra National Park was established in 1938.", "The source of the River Lee is located in the vicinity.", "The area is part of a significant blanket bog ecosystem."],
