      en: ["Elevation: 390 metres above sea level", "Part of the unique Burren karst landscape", "Geology: Carboniferous limestone pavements", "Home to a mix of Arctic and Mediterranean flora", "Offers views of Galway Bay", "Surrounded by numerous Neolithic monuments"],
